/**
 * Small field-guide glyphs drawn in one line weight. Each path has a
 * pathLength of 100 so the parent can draw it in with a dash animation.
 * Purely decorative: the text beside a glyph always carries the meaning.
 *
 * Drawing: add `glyph--draw` and put the glyph inside a `.reveal` block.
 * The lines grow once when that block is seen; reduced motion, or no
 * motion script, shows them finished.
 */
